{"id":"chatcmpl-dff3d872-b23e-4e43-a5c3-08611913eefa","object":"chat.completion","created":1795229656,"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"","content":"```json\n{\n  \"highlights\": \"This task demonstrates how to resolve left/right ambiguity in medical imaging by reading orientation markers and applying standard radiological conventions before interpreting findings. The key insight is that image-space location must be translated to patient-space anatomy using explicit metadata (markers) rather than naive viewer perspective. Verification via a grounding tool confirmed the visual interpretation.\",\n  \"patterns\": [\n    \"When an image contains orientation/laterality markers, read them first and use them to map image sides to patient anatomy before interpreting any finding.\",\n    \"Apply domain-standard conventions (e.g., radiological: patient's left appears on viewer's right) as a default, but override with explicit markers when present.\",\n    \"Localize candidate findings spatially and cross-check their position against the established orientation frame before selecting an answer.\",\n    \"Use a targeted grounding/verification tool to confirm the location and nature of a visual finding when ambiguity or high stakes exist.\"\n  ],\n  \"playbooks\": {\n    \"Medical imaging interpretation\": \"Always establish laterality from markers and standard conventions before localizing findings; never assume viewer-left equals patient-left.\",\n    \"Visual question answering with spatial options\": \"Convert image-space coordinates to the option's reference frame (patient/object-centric) using any available metadata before choosing.\",\n    \"Ambiguous localization tasks\": \"Identify the disambiguating cue (marker, label, convention) early, then verify the finding's position relative to that cue.\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm orientation: locate any laterality/orientation markers and state the image-to-anatomy mapping explicitly.\",\n    \"Verify the finding's side against the established mapping (and via a grounding tool if available) before finalizing the answer.\"\n  ]\n}\n```"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":521,"total_tokens":882,"completion_tokens":361,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":521},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":361}}}